                    "latex": "\\frac{1}{1(3)}+\\frac{1}{3(5)}+\\frac{1}{5(7)}+\\cdots+\\left(\\frac{1}{(2k-1)(2k+1)}\\right)=\\frac{k}{2k+1}",
