                  },
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "\\frac{1}{1(3)}+\\frac{1}{3(5)}+\\frac{1}{5(7)}+\\cdots+\\left(\\frac{1}{(2k-1)(2k+1)}\\right)+\\left(\\frac{1}{(2(k+1)-1)(2(k+1)+1)}\\right)=\\frac{k+1}{2(k+1)+1}",
